config SUNWAVE_FP
	bool "Sunwave fingerprint sensor control"
	depends on INPUT && OF && TRUSTKERNEL_TEE_FP_SUPPORT
	help
	  /dev/sunwave_fp and the fingerprint_key input device on the
	  mediatek,fingerprint node, as the stock sunwave-fp driver, for
	  the stock Sunwave fingerprint HAL. The TrustKernel TA reads the
	  sensor over SPI0, so this only needs the TEE and the SPI0 clock.
